1. In google type "helm install ubuntu"

2. Select https://helm.sh/docs/intro/install/ (Will got there website)

3. In Ubuntu Run the following command to check helm is installed or not:
which helm

4. To install helm use the following command:
curl -s https://raw.githubusercontent.com/helm/helm/main/scripts/get-helm-4 | bash

5. To check Helm Version use: helm version

6. To create Helm-chart with default templates and files use the following commands: 
helm create <chart-name>